# K462 raw pre-enum dispatch list. `raw-check.sh` parses
# kernel/src/syscall/mod.rs between `fn dispatch_inner` and
# `match Syscall::from_usize(number)` and requires exactly these expressions, the numeric value at
# the named definition line, a `RAW_<name>` reference in src/main.rs for every fuzz/child row, and
# no `RAW_<name>` reference for every exclude row. Format:
#   expression <TAB> number <TAB> definition-file:line <TAB> disposition <TAB> dispatch <TAB> name
